{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c34324c-db0e-11ef-a401-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c34320e-db0e-11ef-b541-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"城濮","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"晉侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋侯","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bea62ae9-db0e-11ef-8454-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bea62aea-db0e-11ef-9832-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bea62aeb-db0e-11ef-94be-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"城濮","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bea62aec-db0e-11ef-8e75-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"有莘","place_name_jianti_auto":"有莘","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"bea62aed-db0e-11ef-b98a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"bea62aee-db0e-11ef-9219-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：晉楚戰于城濮。晉侯登有莘之虛以觀師，曰：「少長有禮，其可用也。」遂戰，楚師敗績。治，直之翻；下同。少，詩照翻。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：晋楚战于城濮。晋侯登有莘之虚以观师，曰：「少长有礼，其可用也。」遂战，楚师败绩。治，直之翻；下同。少，诗照翻。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bea62ae8-db0e-11ef-884d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賈誼","people_name_jianti_auto":"贾谊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bea62af1-db0e-11ef-b7db-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賈誼廉陛之論，正此意。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贾谊廉陛之论，正此意。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"bea62af0-db0e-11ef-b942-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"城濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"城濮","resolved_place_entity_id":6311,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bea62af3-db0e-11ef-8f72-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"今为莘仲集。又有莘城，见陕西郃阳县。○济阳城，《志》云：...","context_before":"...里。《夏本纪》：鲧纳有莘氏女，生禹。又伊尹耕于有莘之野。","source_end_index":97,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"73a4f176-5f5e-507b-ab25-d82c692baa4a","source_start_index":57,"source_text":"《春秋》：僖二十八年，晋侯次于城濮，登有莘氏之墟以观师。杜预曰：古莘国城。是也。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"蓋古者治軍必本於禮，故晉文公城濮之戰，見其師少長有禮，知其可用。今唐治軍而不顧禮，使士卒得以陵偏裨，偏裨得以陵將帥，則將帥之陵天子，自然之勢也。","content_fanyi":"大概古代治理军队必定以礼法为根本，所以晋文公在城濮之战中，看到军中长幼之间都合乎礼数，就知道这支军队可以任用。如今唐朝治理军队却不顾礼法，使士兵能够欺凌副将，副将能够欺凌主帅，那么主帅欺凌天子，就是自然发展的趋势了。","content_jianti_auto":"盖古者治军必本于礼，故晋文公城濮之战，见其师少长有礼，知其可用。今唐治军而不顾礼，使士卒得以陵偏裨，偏裨得以陵将帅，则将帅之陵天子，自然之势也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":22263,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百二十 (唐紀三十六) / 肅宗文明武德大聖大宣孝皇帝中之下 / 乾元元年 / 第 50 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"bea62ae7-db0e-11ef-96b3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":758},"tongjian_id":"bea62ae7-db0e-11ef-96b3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"城濮"},"message":"success","success":true}